<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: RUGBY UNION-IRISH FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-IRISH FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Irish first division</p>
<p>rugby union matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Ballymena	     12     Old Belvedere	3   </p>
<p> Cork Constitution   47     Dungannon	    4   </p>
<p> Garryowen	     18     Old Wesley	  28    </p>
<p> Instonians	    12     Young Munster     22    </p>
<p> Lansdowne	     42     Blackrock College 18    </p>
<p> Shannon		 28     Old Crescent	15    </p>
<p> St Mary's College    0     Terenure College  14</p>
